# Git commit messages (SCM Generate Commit Message)

When generating a Git commit message for this repository, ALWAYS write the subject and body in Turkish. Never write English commit messages.

- Keep conventional commit prefixes in English: feat:, fix:, chore:, refactor:, docs:, test:, style:, perf:
- The text after the prefix MUST be Turkish
- Use a single concise subject line. Add a short Turkish body only if the change is non-obvious
- Do not restate the diff line by line in English

Examples:
feat: header stillerine chrome-solid sınıfı eklendi
fix: sipariş listesinde boş durum hatası giderildi
chore: bağımlılıklar güncellendi
